[
  {
    "content_id": "10064001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;作长老的写信给亲爱的该犹，就是我诚心所爱的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的兄弟啊，我愿你凡事兴盛，身体健壮，正如你的灵魂兴盛一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;有弟兄来证明你心里存的真理，正如你按真理而行，我就甚喜乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我听见我的儿女们按真理而行，我的喜乐就没有比这个大的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的兄弟啊，凡你向作客旅之弟兄所行的都是忠心的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;他们在教会面前证明了你的爱；你若配得过　神，帮助他们往前行，这就好了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;因他们是为主的名出外，对于外邦人一无所取。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;所以我们应该接待这样的人，叫我们与他们一同为真理做工。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我曾略略地写信给教会，但那在教会中好为首的丢特腓不接待我们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;所以我若去，必要提说他所行的事，就是他用恶言妄论我们。还不以此为足，他自己不接待弟兄，有人愿意接待，他也禁止，并且将接待弟兄的人赶出教会。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的兄弟啊，不要效法恶，只要效法善。行善的属乎　神；行恶的未曾见过　神。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;低米丢行善，有众人给他作见证，又有真理给他作见证，就是我们也给他作见证。你也知道我们的见证是真的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我原有许多事要写给你，却不愿意用笔墨写给你，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;但盼望快快地见你，我们就当面谈论。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;愿你平安。众位朋友都问你安。请你替我按着姓名问众位朋友安。</p>"
  }
]